:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Squid (Enemy)]].''
'''Squid''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can obtained from the [[Summer Break Cats Castaway (Event Gacha)|Summer Break Cats Castaway]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]] using Legend Traps. It was added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 767
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Squid
|name2 = Squid CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Squid CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Squid can be used in much the same way as [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]], but it has one major drawback—it costs 60% more than Cat and most other Cat clones. On top of this, the Freeze and Slow immunities usually aren't worth the cost, unless playing in a stage with [[Henry]] or [[Croakley]] (and even then, Squid only survives a single hit from each at level 30, with it being one-shot outright by a 150% Croakley). Most other enemies with Freeze or Slow abilities will simply kill this squid in one hit. As a result, Squid is usually a bad choice for an extra Cat-like meatshield, and only grows exponentially worse in stages that are lengthier and require more meatshields to be spawned, or in stages where money management is very important.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

